## Build & Deployment

### Maven Commands
```bash
# Build project
./mvnw clean install

# Run tests
./mvnw test

# Run specific test class
./mvnw test -Dtest=VaccinationServiceTest

# Run application
./mvnw spring-boot:run

# Build production JAR
./mvnw clean package -DskipTests

# Check dependency security
./mvnw dependency-check:check
```

### Application Properties
```properties
# Server
server.port=8080
server.servlet.context-path=/api

# Database
spring.datasource.url=jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/vaccination_db
spring.datasource.username=${DB_USERNAME}
spring.datasource.password=${DB_PASSWORD}
spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=validate
spring.jpa.show-sql=false

# JWT
app.jwt.secret=${JWT_SECRET}
app.jwt.expiration=86400000

# Logging
logging.level.root=INFO
logging.level.com.example.vaccination=DEBUG

# Flyway
spring.flyway.enabled=true
spring.flyway.locations=classpath:db/migration
```

## Code Quality & CI/CD

### Pre-commit Checklist
1. All tests pass locally: `./mvnw test`
2. No hardcoded secrets or credentials
3. No email addresses or MSSV in code
4. Meaningful commit messages
5. Code follows this .cursorrules
6. Log file created (log-tac-tu/PR-XX.md)
7. PR description complete with 3 required fields

### Automated Checks (GitHub Actions)
- `kiem-pr` runs on every PR
- Checks code style, tests, log files
- PR can't merge if checks fail

