## Common Patterns & Examples

### Pagination Example
```java
@GetMapping
public Page<VaccinationDTO> listVaccinations(
    @PageableDefault(size = 20, page = 0) Pageable pageable) {
  return vaccinationService.getAll(pageable)
    .map(VaccinationMapper::toDTO);
}
```

### Error Handling Example
```java
@ExceptionHandler(VaccinationNotFoundException.class)
public ResponseEntity<ErrorResponse> handleNotFound(VaccinationNotFoundException e) {
  ErrorResponse error = new ErrorResponse("NOT_FOUND", e.getMessage());
  return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.NOT_FOUND).body(error);
}
```

### Transaction Example
```java
@Service
@Transactional
public class VaccinationService {
  @Transactional(readOnly = true)
  public Vaccination getById(Long id) {
    return vaccinationRepository.findById(id)
      .orElseThrow(() -> new VaccinationNotFoundException(id));
  }
  
  public Vaccination create(VaccinationDTO dto) {
    Vaccination vaccination = new Vaccination();
    vaccination.setVaccineName(dto.getVaccineName());
    return vaccinationRepository.save(vaccination);
  }
}
```

### Constructor Injection Example
```java
@Service
public class VaccinationService {
  private final VaccinationRepository vaccinationRepository;
  private final UserRepository userRepository;
  
  public VaccinationService(
      VaccinationRepository vaccinationRepository,
      UserRepository userRepository) {
    this.vaccinationRepository = vaccinationRepository;
    this.userRepository = userRepository;
  }
}
```

